rview is here:\n\nIt launched at 6am on a Sunday and had garnered over 6,000 views by 9:30 am —when Owen Muir is writing this.\n\nWe talk about accelerated TMS, fMRI guided neuromodulation, my personal experience with bipolar depression, and more.\n\nHope you enjoy it!\n\nShare The Frontier Psychiatrists"}